 ('ENT_SUF_NIMATULLAHI','PER_ISL_MEDIEVAL','Persian Sufi order founded by Shah Ni''matullah Wali, the most widespread tariqa in Iran.'),
 ('ENT_SUF_KUBRAWI','PER_ISL_CLASSICAL','Central Asian Sufi order founded by Najm al-Din Kubra, noted for its visionary psychology of luminous colours.'),
