 ('ENT_SUF_QUNAWI','PER_ISL_MEDIEVAL','Persian-Anatolian metaphysician (d. 1274), stepson and chief successor of Ibn al-Arabi who systematized his teaching of the oneness of being.'),
 ('ENT_SUF_IRAQI','PER_ISL_MEDIEVAL','Persian Sufi poet (d. 1289), disciple of Qunawi''s circle, whose Lama''at expounds Ibn al-Arabi''s doctrine through the imagery of love.'),
