 ('ENT_SUF_KUBRA','member_of','ENT_SUF_KUBRAWI','high','Eponymous founder of the Kubrawiyya.'),
 ('ENT_SUF_HAMADANI','member_of','ENT_SUF_KUBRAWI','high','Kubrawi master in the line of Najm al-Din Kubra.'),
