 ('ENT_SUF_MANERI','reception_of','ENT_SUF_SUHRAWARDI','medium','Of the Firdausiyya, a Suhrawardi branch in India.'),
 ('ENT_SUF_SAFI_ARDABILI','reception_of','ENT_SUF_SUHRAWARDI','low','His Safaviyya silsila descends through the broader Suhrawardi-Zahidi line.'),
 ('ENT_SUF_HAMADANI','reception_of','ENT_SUF_KUBRA','medium','Transmitted the Kubrawi visionary path founded by Najm al-Din Kubra.'),
 ('ENT_SUF_YUNUS_EMRE','aligned_with','ENT_SUF_RUMI','medium','Turkish saint-poet writing in the wake of Rumi''s Anatolian devotional milieu.'),
