 ('ENT_SUF_LAL_DED','aligned_with','ENT_SUF_HAMADANI','low','Kashmiri contemporary devotion overlapping with the Hamadani Sufi presence.'),
 ('ENT_SUF_BADAWI','aligned_with','ENT_SUF_JILANI','low','Counted among the great popular saints venerated alongside Abd al-Qadir al-Jilani.'),
 ('ENT_SUF_DASUQI','aligned_with','ENT_SUF_BADAWI','medium','Counted among the four great qutbs of Egyptian Sufism with al-Badawi.'),
